WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.067
An update now on

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:03.069
a disturbing story out of Kenya

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:04.838
that we've been following very closely.

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:05.271
More than

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:07.340
300 bodies

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.942
have been found in shallow graves

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:09.609
in a forest

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:11.644
and authorities say scores of mass graves

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:13.580
are yet to be uncovered.

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.315
Most of the victims

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:16.016
were followers

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:17.584
of a controversial pastor

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:19.986
who is now in police custody

00:00:19.986 --> 00:00:22.022
His followers were allegedly brainwashed

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:24.424
into believing that starvation

00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:27.594
was their ticket to salvation.

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:28.762
CNN's David McKenzie

00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:29.662
traveled to the area.

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:31.664
He joins us live now from Johannesburg.

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:33.366
So, David,

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:34.300
even though the pastor,

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.969
Pastor McKenzie's, is being held

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:38.071
at this point in time,

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:40.640
the psychological wounds for.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.675
Yes, the family members of the victims,

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:43.943
but also the community

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:47.247
at large will take a very long time

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:48.248
to heal.

00:00:48.248 --> 00:00:49.716
Just walk us through

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:52.218
what was said by the people you spoke to.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:55.755
Well, certainly

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:58.958
the wounds will be there for a long time.

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:01.528
And the true scale of this horror

00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:03.897
hasn't even yet been fully uncovered.

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:04.697
Zain.

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:06.166
And it is sort of described

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:07.133
how long it will take.

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:09.569
65 of the followers of this cult

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:11.571
are still refusing to eat.

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:13.640
They believe that the pastor

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:16.443
held their ticket to salvation

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:18.011
and that salvation

00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:20.013
was the way to get there.

00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:21.581
And I must warn some viewers

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:22.816
that the themes

00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:23.683
and images

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:26.686
in the story could be disturbing.

00:01:26.686 --> 00:01:28.555
He called it the wilderness,

00:01:28.555 --> 00:01:29.622
luring his flock

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:31.891
to a remote corner of Kenya.

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:33.393
We've come to try and understand

00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:35.895
how over many months so many could die

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:38.431
in the shack, a hole of forest.

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:41.501
The dead are still being found.

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:43.970
Forensic teams carefully remove

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:45.271
the remains of members

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:47.240
of a Christian death cult

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:49.409
from shallow graves.

00:01:49.409 --> 00:01:50.410
They have already unearthed

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:52.579
more than 300 people

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:54.080
many of them children,

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:56.149
many showing signs of starvation.

00:01:56.883 --> 00:01:57.517
It's painful,

00:01:58.651 --> 00:02:00.587
just so painful.

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:03.890
It was so painful.

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:05.258
This is my daughter.

00:02:05.258 --> 00:02:07.093
Francis Wanja says his daughter

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:08.294
and son in law

00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:09.195
both abandoned

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:10.897
good jobs and took their children

00:02:10.897 --> 00:02:12.532
to the forest cult.

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:15.168
What happened next is hard to comprehend.

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:18.738
It today a tribute to Jesus

00:02:20.273 --> 00:02:22.675
and they have to start with the children.

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:23.910
The members of the cult,

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:25.478
including your own family.

00:02:25.478 --> 00:02:28.348
They were starving the children. Yes.

00:02:28.414 --> 00:02:30.150
And then when the children didn't

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:32.552
die quickly enough to suffocate them,

00:02:32.552 --> 00:02:34.521
suffocate them? Yes.

00:02:34.521 --> 00:02:36.523
And this is your own blood.

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:39.092
And I wonder where my children

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:41.928
or my child my daughter

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:45.031
could change

00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:47.000
to be such an animal.

00:02:47.967 --> 00:02:49.702
A world animal

00:02:50.403 --> 00:02:53.673
to kill her own children.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.009
Pastor Paul McKenzie began

00:02:56.009 --> 00:02:57.844
his cult in Malindi.

00:02:57.844 --> 00:03:00.313
This is the church where Pastor McKenzie

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:03.416
had a huge following in his sermons.

00:03:05.685 --> 00:03:08.221
Yes, he amplified his message online.

00:03:08.621 --> 00:03:10.356
He preached a doomsday prophecy

00:03:10.356 --> 00:03:12.392
for at least a decade,

00:03:12.392 --> 00:03:13.526
calling on the faithful

00:03:13.526 --> 00:03:15.562
to reject modern society,

00:03:15.562 --> 00:03:17.030
poor children from school,

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:18.665
avoid hospitals.

00:03:18.665 --> 00:03:21.067
He demanded total devotion.

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:22.535
Study to kill time.

00:03:22.535 --> 00:03:23.736
You must deny yourself.

00:03:23.736 --> 00:03:25.438
You must reject yourself.

00:03:25.438 --> 00:03:26.406
You must reach a point

00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:28.441
of ending your life, he says.

00:03:28.441 --> 00:03:30.643
For the sake of Jesus,

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:31.544
his anti-government

00:03:31.544 --> 00:03:33.746
stance got him arrested and detained,

00:03:34.247 --> 00:03:35.949
but never prosecuted.

00:03:35.949 --> 00:03:38.451
In 2019, the church was closed down.

00:03:38.851 --> 00:03:39.285
Later,

00:03:39.285 --> 00:03:41.788
the pastor started his forest community

00:03:42.689 --> 00:03:45.058
We found a former cult member in Malindi.

00:03:45.458 --> 00:03:47.160
We agreed to hide her identity

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.962
for her own safety.

00:03:48.962 --> 00:03:50.964
She escaped the forest last year.

00:03:50.964 --> 00:03:53.199
Why did you move your whole home

00:03:53.199 --> 00:03:54.300
and all your children

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:56.002
and move into the forest?

00:03:56.002 --> 00:03:58.338
Oh, I'm fine. Yes.

00:03:58.338 --> 00:03:59.572
The pastor used to call me.

00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:01.574
She says he was calling me, telling me

00:04:01.941 --> 00:04:02.809
my daughter.

00:04:02.809 --> 00:04:04.811
You are being left behind.

00:04:04.811 --> 00:04:06.613
And when the ark is closed,

00:04:06.613 --> 00:04:09.415
it will be too late. So I decided to go.

00:04:10.383 --> 00:04:12.218
When the COVID pandemic hit,

00:04:12.218 --> 00:04:13.353
she says, many saw it

00:04:13.353 --> 00:04:15.355
as evidence that the prophecies

00:04:15.355 --> 00:04:16.723
were real.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:19.492
McKenzie charged her family $80

00:04:19.492 --> 00:04:21.694
for a piece of land in Galilee.

00:04:21.694 --> 00:04:22.495
There were seven

00:04:22.495 --> 00:04:24.063
other biblically named settlements

00:04:24.063 --> 00:04:25.265
in Kajola,

00:04:25.265 --> 00:04:27.166
with more than a thousand followers,

00:04:27.166 --> 00:04:28.434
she says.

00:04:28.468 --> 00:04:29.636
Still, cult members

00:04:29.636 --> 00:04:30.670
made regular trips

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:32.138
to a nearby village for food

00:04:32.138 --> 00:04:34.073
and water in December.

00:04:34.073 --> 00:04:35.174
Those trips suddenly

00:04:35.174 --> 00:04:36.943
stopped, says this village elders

00:04:36.943 --> 00:04:37.243
among them

00:04:37.243 --> 00:04:38.945
to try not to stick up anymore.

00:04:38.945 --> 00:04:40.647
The starvation had begun,

00:04:40.647 --> 00:04:42.181
she declared, Would you name it?

00:04:42.181 --> 00:04:44.050
He says they alerted authorities,

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.451
but they did nothing.

00:04:45.451 --> 00:04:46.352
Even after hungry

00:04:46.352 --> 00:04:48.988
children started escaping to the village,

00:04:50.223 --> 00:04:51.324
what's been called the Shaka

00:04:51.324 --> 00:04:53.893
Houla massacre has shocked this nation.

00:04:54.527 --> 00:04:56.262
Pastor McKenzie and his closest

00:04:56.262 --> 00:04:57.430
followers are being held

00:04:57.430 --> 00:04:58.998
anti-terror laws.

00:04:58.998 --> 00:05:00.366
What happened in the forest

00:05:00.366 --> 00:05:01.367
with your followers?

00:05:01.367 --> 00:05:03.603
I can tell nothing about that

00:05:03.603 --> 00:05:04.804
because I've been in custody

00:05:04.804 --> 00:05:05.838
for two months.

00:05:05.838 --> 00:05:06.773
So I don't know

00:05:06.773 --> 00:05:08.541
what is going outside then.

00:05:08.541 --> 00:05:09.242
Have you been there

00:05:10.777 --> 00:05:11.577
Francis Windsor

00:05:11.577 --> 00:05:13.613
says there needs to be justice.

00:05:13.613 --> 00:05:15.114
He mounted a rescue mission

00:05:15.114 --> 00:05:17.116
to get his grandchildren out

00:05:17.116 --> 00:05:19.285
when they found his grandson, Ephraim.

00:05:19.285 --> 00:05:21.287
He was close to starvation.

00:05:21.287 --> 00:05:23.456
His two brothers were already dead.

00:05:23.656 --> 00:05:25.325
He went through hell

00:05:26.459 --> 00:05:27.794
he went through hell.

00:05:27.794 --> 00:05:29.962
I'm telling. In fact,

00:05:30.496 --> 00:05:33.933
when he was rescued, he told him that

00:05:33.933 --> 00:05:36.302
if you could come here,

