What did you find me?

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:43.476
I had already gone to see Jesus.

00:05:43.476 --> 00:05:44.210
Cause

00:05:44.977 --> 00:05:46.879
the grave is there

00:05:47.146 --> 00:05:47.613
now.

00:05:47.847 --> 00:05:49.749
At the very highest levels

00:05:49.749 --> 00:05:50.850
of the Kenyan government

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:52.852
have apologized for their inaction

00:05:53.219 --> 00:05:56.255
and the pain it has caused

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:58.224
the scale

00:05:58.224 --> 00:05:59.525
of what happened in the forest

00:05:59.525 --> 00:06:01.728
is still being understood.

00:06:01.728 --> 00:06:03.463
Hundreds are still missing,

00:06:03.463 --> 00:06:05.064
and many more mass graves

00:06:05.064 --> 00:06:06.332
need to be exhumed

00:06:09.068 --> 00:06:11.404
David McKenzie is with me again now.

00:06:11.404 --> 00:06:12.872
I mean, the fact that this could happen,

00:06:12.872 --> 00:06:15.007
