on the ground.

00:06:38.998 --> 00:06:41.401
Many people were frustrated that

00:06:41.401 --> 00:06:42.668
they had warned

00:06:42.668 --> 00:06:44.937
the authorities that warned the police

00:06:44.971 --> 00:06:46.105
there were strange things

00:06:46.105 --> 00:06:47.340
happening in that forest

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:48.574
